raphs","definition":{"zh":"功劳木1000g\n\n鸡骨香250g\n\n黄连须375g\n\n葛根200g\n\n救必应250g\n\n凤尾草375g\n\n两面针250g\n\n防己25g"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/1349","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"zh":"肠康片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"zh":"盐酸小檗碱50g\n\n木香313g\n\n制吴茱萸125g"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/135","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"DENDROBII CAULIS","zh":"石斛"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为兰科植物金钗石斛Dendrobium nobile Lindl.、霍山石斛Dendrobium huoshanense C. Z. Tang et S. J. Cheng、鼓槌石斛Dendrobium chrysotoxum Lindl.或流苏石斛Dendrobium fimbriatum Hook.的栽培品及其同属植物近似种的新鲜或干燥茎。全年均可采收，鲜用者除去根和泥沙；干用者采收后，除去杂质，用开水略烫或烘软，再边搓边烘晒，至叶鞘搓净，干燥。霍山石斛11月至翌年3月采收，除去叶、根须及泥沙等杂质，洗净，鲜用，或加热除去叶鞘制成干条；或边加热边扭成螺旋状或弹簧状，干燥，称霍山石斛枫斗。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/1350","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"zh":"龟鹿二仙膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"zh":"龟甲250g\n\n鹿角250g\n\n党参47g\n\n枸杞子94g"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/1351","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"zh":"龟鹿补肾丸"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"zh":"盐菟丝子51g\n\n淫羊藿（蒸）43g\n\n续断（盐蒸）43g\n\n锁阳（蒸）51g\n\n狗脊（盐蒸）64g\n\n酸枣仁（炒）43g\n\n制何首乌64g\n\n炙甘草21g\n\n陈皮（蒸）21g\n\n鹿角胶（炒）9g\n\n熟地黄64g\n\n龟甲胶（炒）13g\n\n金樱子（蒸）51g\n\n炙黄芪43g\n\n山药（炒）43g\n\n覆盆子（蒸）85g"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/1352","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"zh":"辛夷鼻炎丸"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"zh":"辛夷42g\n\n薄荷433g\n\n紫苏叶317g\n\n甘草215g\n\n广藿香433g\n\n苍耳子1111g\n\n鹅不食草209g\n\n板蓝根650g\n\n山白芷433g\n\n防风313g\n\n鱼腥草150g\n\n菊花433g\n\n三叉苦433g"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/1353","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"zh":"辛芩片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"zh":"细辛333g\n\n黄芩333g\n\n荆芥333g\n\n防风333g\n\n白芷333g\n\n苍耳子333g\n\n黄芪333g\n\n白术333g\n\n桂枝333g\n\n石菖蒲3