Monograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Sodium Glycerophosphate","zh":"甘油磷酸钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C3H7Na2O6P　216.04\n\n本品为α-甘油磷酸钠与β-甘油磷酸钠的混合物，按无水物计算，含C3H7Na2O6P应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2498","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Sodium Glycerophosphate Injection","zh":"甘油磷酸钠注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为甘油磷酸钠的灭菌水溶液，含磷（P）应为28.80～33.14mg/ml，含钠（Na）应为43.68～48.28mg/ml。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2499","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Glycididazole Sodium","zh":"甘氨双唑钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C18H22N7NaO10•3H2O　573.45\n\n本品为N，N-双［2-［（2-甲基-5-硝基-1H-咪唑-1-基）乙氧基］-2-氧代-乙基］甘氨酸钠三水合物。按无水无残留溶剂计算，含C18H22N7NaO10应为97.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/25","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"SARGENTODOXAE CAULIS","zh":"大血藤"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为木通科植物大血藤Sargentodoxa cuneata（Oliv.）Rehd. et Wils.的干燥藤茎。秋、冬二季采收，除去侧枝，截段，干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/250","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"ATRACTYLODIS RHIZOMA","zh":"苍术"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为菊科植物茅苍术Atractylodes lancea（Thunb.）DC.或北苍术Atractylodes chinensis（DC.）Koidz.的干燥根茎。春、秋二季采挖，除去泥沙，晒干，撞去须根。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2500","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Glycididazole Sodium for Injection","zh":"注射用甘氨双唑钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为甘氨双唑钠的无菌冻干品。按平均装量计算，含无水甘氨双唑钠（C18H22N7NaO10）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2501","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Glycyl Glutamine","zh":"甘氨酰谷氨酰胺"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C7H13N3O4•H2O　221.21\n\n［172669-64-6］\n\n本品为甘氨酰-L-谷氨酰胺一水合物。按无水物计算，含C7H13