abel":{"en":"Powdered Thyroid","zh":"甲状腺粉"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品系取猪、牛、羊等食用动物的甲状腺体，除去结缔组织与脂肪，绞碎、脱水、脱脂，在60℃以下的温度干燥，研细制成，必要时（如左甲状腺素与碘塞罗宁含量较高）可加乳糖、蔗糖、氯化钠或淀粉均匀稀释。按干燥品计算，每1g含左甲状腺素（C15H11I4NO4，T4）与碘塞罗宁（C15H12I3NO4，T3）应分别为0.52～0.64mg和0.13～0.15mg。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2638","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Thyroid Tablets","zh":"甲状腺片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品按甲状腺粉的标示量计算，每1mg中含左甲状腺素（C15H11I4NO4，T4）与碘塞罗宁（C15H12I3NO4，T3）应分别为0.52～0.64μg和0.13～0.15μg。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2639","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Mebendazole","zh":"甲苯咪唑"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C16H13N3O3　295.30\n\n［31431-39-7］\n\n本品为5-苯甲酰基-2-苯并咪唑氨基甲酸甲酯。按干燥品计算，含C16H13N3O3应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/264","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"GLECHOMAE HERBA","zh":"连钱草"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为唇形科植物活血丹Glechoma longituba（Nakai）Kupr.的干燥地上部分。春至秋季采收，除去杂质，晒干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2640","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Mebendazole Tablets","zh":"甲苯咪唑片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含甲苯咪唑（C16H13N3O3）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2641","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Tolbutamide","zh":"甲苯磺丁脲"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C12H18N2O3S　270.35\n\n［64-77-7］\n\n本品为1-丁基-3-（对甲苯基磺酰基）脲。按干燥品计算，含C12H18N2O3S不得少于99.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2642","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Tolbutamide Tablets","zh":"甲苯磺丁脲片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含甲苯磺丁脲（C12H18N2O3S）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2643","@type":"Indexed