g/data/chp/monographs/2910","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Triamcinolone Acetonide Injection","zh":"曲安奈德注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为曲安奈德的无菌混悬液。含曲安奈德（C24H31FO6）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2911","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Triamcinolone Acetonide and Econazole Nitrate Cream","zh":"曲安奈德益康唑乳膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含曲安奈德（C24H31FO6）应为标示量的90.0%～115.0%；含硝酸益康唑（C18H15Cl3N2O•HNO3）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2912","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Troxerutin","zh":"曲克芦丁"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C33H42O19　742.68\n\n［7085-55-4］\n\n本品为曲克芦丁（7，3′，4′-三羟乙基芦丁）为主的羟乙基芦丁混合物。按无水物计算，含曲克芦丁（C33H42O19）不得少于80.0%（供口服用）或88.0%（供注射用）。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2913","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Troxerutin Tablets","zh":"曲克芦丁片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含曲克芦丁（C33H42O19）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2914","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Mycophenolate Mofetil","zh":"吗替麦考酚酯"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C23H31NO7　433.50\n\n［128794-94-5］\n\n本品为（E）-6-（4-羟基-6-甲氧基-7-甲基-3-氧代-1，3-二氢异苯并呋喃-5-基）-4-甲基-4-己烯酸2-（吗啉-4-基）乙酯。按干燥品计算，含吗替麦考酚酯（C23H31NO7）应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2915","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Mycophenolate Mofetil Tablets","zh":"吗替麦考酚酯片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含吗替麦考酚酯（C23H31NO7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2916","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Mycophenolate Mofetil Dispersible Tablets","zh":"吗替麦考酚酯分散片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含吗替麦考酚酯（C23H31NO7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2917","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Mycophenolate Mofetil Capsules","zh":"吗替麦考酚酯胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含吗替麦考酚酯（C23H31NO7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2918","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Moclobemide","zh":"吗氯贝胺"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C13H17ClN2O2　268.74\n\n［71320-77-9］\n\n本品为4-氯-N-［2-（4-吗啉基乙基）］苯甲酰胺。按干燥品计算，含C13H17ClN2O2不得少于99.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2919","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Moclobemide Tablets","zh":"吗氯贝胺片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含吗氯贝胺（C13H17ClN2O2）应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/292","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"FERULAE RESINA","zh":"阿魏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为伞形科植物新疆阿魏Ferula sinkiangensis K. M. Shen或阜康阿魏Ferula fukanensis K. M. Shen的树脂。春末夏初盛花期至初果期，分次由茎上部往下斜割，收集渗出的乳状树脂，阴干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2920","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Moclobemide Capsules","zh":"吗氯贝胺胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含吗氯贝胺（C13H17ClN2O2）应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2921","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Gadobenate Dimeglumine Injection","zh":"钆贝葡胺注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为钆贝葡胺（C22H28GdN3O11•2C7H17NO5）的灭菌水溶液。含钆贝酸（C22H28GdN3O11）及葡甲胺（C7H17NO5）均应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2922","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Gadopentetate Dimeglumine Injection","zh":"钆喷酸葡胺注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C14H20GdN3O10•2C7H17NO5　938.01\n\n本品为钆喷酸双葡甲胺的灭菌水溶液。含钆喷酸双葡甲胺（C14H20GdN3O10•2C7H17NO5）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2923","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Voriconazole","zh":"伏立康唑"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C16H14F3N5O　349.32\n\n［137234-62-9］\n\n本品为（2R，3S）-2-（2，4-二氟苯基）-3-（5-氟-4-嘧啶基）-1-（1H-1，2，4-三氮唑-1-基）-2-丁醇。按干燥品计算，含C16H14F3N5O不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2924","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Voriconazole Tablets","zh":"伏立康唑片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含伏立康唑（C16H14F3N5O）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2925","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Voriconazole Capsules","zh":"伏立康唑胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含伏立康唑（C16H14F3N5O）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2926","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Voglibose","zh":"伏格列波糖"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C10H21NO7　267.28\n\n［83480-29-9］\n\n本品以井冈霉素A为起始原料，先经微生物发酵，再经过合成工艺制备而得。本品为（+）-（1S，2S，3R，4S，5S）-5-［（1，3-二羟基丙烷-2-基）氨基］-1-羟甲基-1，2，3，4-环己四醇。按无水物计算，含C10H21NO7不得少于99.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2927","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Voglibose Tablets","zh":"伏格列波糖片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含伏格列波糖（C10H21NO7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2928","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Voglibose Capsules","zh":"伏格列波糖胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含伏格列波糖（C10H21NO7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2929","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Warfarin Sodium","zh":"华法林钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C19H15NaO4　330.31\n\n［129-06-6］\n\n本品为3-（α-丙酮基苄基）-4-羟基香豆素钠盐。按无水与无异丙醇物计算，含C19H15NaO4应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/293","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"CITRI RETICULATAE PERICARPIUM","zh":"陈皮"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为芸香科植物橘Citrus reticulata Blanco及其栽培变种的干燥成熟果皮。药材分为\"陈皮\"和\"广陈皮\"。采摘成熟果实，剥取果皮，晒干或低温干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2930","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Warfarin Sodium Tablets","zh":"华法林钠片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含华法林钠（C19H15NaO4）应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2931","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Itraconazole","zh":"伊曲康唑"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C35H38Cl2N8O4　705.64\n\n［84625-61-6］\n\n本品为（±）-1-仲丁基-4-［4-［4-［4-［［（2R∗，4S∗）-2-（2，4-二氯苯基）-2-（1H-1，2，4-三氮唑基-1-甲基）-1，3-二氧环戊-4-基］甲氧基］苯基］-1-哌嗪基］苯基］-Δ2-1，2，4-三氮唑-5-酮。按干燥品计算，含C35H38Cl2N8O4不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2932","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Itraconazole Capsules","zh":"伊曲康唑胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含伊曲康唑（C35H38Cl2N8O4）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2933","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine","zh":"肌苷"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C10H12N4O5　268.23\n\n［58-63-9］\n\n本品为9β-D-呋喃核糖基次黄嘌呤。按干燥品计算，含C10H12N4O5应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2934","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine Oral Solution","zh":"肌苷口服溶液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含肌苷（C10H12N4O5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2935","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine Tablets","zh":"肌苷片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含肌苷（C10H12N4O5）应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2936","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine Injection","zh":"肌苷注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为肌苷加适宜的辅料制成的灭菌水溶液。含肌苷（C10H12N4O5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2937","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine Capsules","zh":"肌苷胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含肌苷（C10H12N4O5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2938","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine and Glucose Injection","zh":"肌苷葡萄糖注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为肌苷与葡萄糖的灭菌水溶液。含肌苷（C10H12N4O5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%，含葡萄糖（C6H12O6•H2O）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2939","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine and Sodium Chloride Injection","zh":"肌苷氯化钠注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为肌苷与氯化钠的灭菌水溶液。含肌苷（C10H12N4O5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%，含氯化钠（NaCl）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/294","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"ACONITI RADIX LATERALIS PRAEPARATA","zh":"附子"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为毛茛科植物乌头Aconitum carmichaelii Debx.的子根的加工品。6月下旬至8月上旬采挖，除去母根、须根及泥沙，习称\"泥附子\"，加工成下列规格。\n\n（1）选择个大、均匀的泥附子，洗净，浸入胆巴的水溶液中过夜，再加食盐，继续浸泡，每日取出晒晾，并逐渐延长晒晾时间，直至附子表面出现大量结晶盐粒（盐霜）、体质变硬为止，习称\"盐附子\"。\n\n（2）取泥附子，按大小分别洗净，浸入胆巴的水溶液中数日，连同浸液煮至透心，捞出，水漂，纵切成厚约0.5cm的片，再用水浸漂，用调色液使附片染成浓茶色，取出，蒸至出现油面、光泽后，烘至半干，再晒干或继续烘干，习称\"黑顺片\"。\n\n（3）选择大小均匀的泥附子，洗净，浸入胆巴的水溶液中数日，连同浸液煮至透心，捞出，剥去外皮，纵切成厚约0.3cm的片，用水浸漂，取出，蒸透，晒干，习称\"白附片\"。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2940","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine Granules","zh":"肌苷颗粒"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含肌苷（C10H12N4O5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2941","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Inosine for Injection","zh":"注射用肌苷"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为肌苷加甘露醇等适宜的辅料制成的无菌冻干品。按平均装量计算，含肌苷（C10H12N4O5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2942","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Doxofylline","zh":"多索茶碱"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C11H14N4O4　266.26\n\n［69975-86-6］\n\n本品为7-（1，3-二氧戊环-2-基甲基）茶碱。按干燥品计算，含C11H14N4O4应为98.5%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2943","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Doxofylline Tablets","zh":"多索茶碱片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含多索茶碱（C11H14N4O4）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2944","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Doxofylline Injection","zh":"多索茶碱注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为多索茶碱的灭菌水溶液，含多索茶碱（C11H14N4O4）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2945","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Doxofylline Capsules","zh":"多索茶碱胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含多索茶碱（C11H14N4O4）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2946","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Ethyl Polyenoate","zh":"多烯酸乙酯"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品系自海洋鱼类提取的鱼油经精制、酯化而得的多不饱和脂肪酸乙酯化的产品。含二十碳五烯酸乙酯（C22H34O2）和二十二碳六烯酸乙酯（C24H36O2）的总和不得少于84.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2947","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Ethyl Polyenoate Soft Capsules","zh":"多烯酸乙酯软胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为多烯酸乙酯加适量稳定剂制成的软胶囊。含二十碳五烯酸乙酯（C22H34O2）与二十二碳六烯酸乙酯（C24H36O2）的总和不得少于80.0%；按平均装量计算，含二十碳五烯酸乙酯与二十二碳六烯酸乙酯的总和应为标示量的90.0%～115.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2948","@t