0。按干燥品计算，本品每1mg的抗Ⅹa因子效价应为95～130IU，抗Ⅹa因子效价与抗Ⅱa因子效价之比应为2.5～4.0。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2979","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nadroparin Calcium Injection","zh":"那屈肝素钙注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为那屈肝素钙的无菌水溶液。其抗Ⅹa因子效价应为标示量的90%～110%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/298","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"ABRI HERBA","zh":"鸡骨草"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为豆科植物广州相思子Abrus cantoniensis Hance的干燥全株。全年均可采挖，除去泥沙，干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2980","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nateglinide","zh":"那格列奈"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C19H27NO3　317.43\n\n［105816-04-4］\n\n本品为（－）-N-［（反-4-异丙基环己基）甲酰基］-D-苯丙氨酸。按干燥品计算，含C19H27NO3不得少于99.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2981","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nateglinide Tablets","zh":"那格列奈片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含那格列奈（C19H27NO3）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2982","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nateglinide Capsules","zh":"那格列奈胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含那格列奈（C19H27NO3）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2983","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Amobarbital","zh":"异戊巴比妥"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C11H18N2O3　226.28\n\n［57-43-2］\n\n本品为5-乙基-5-（3-甲基丁基）-2，4，6（1H，3H，5H）-嘧啶三酮。按干燥品计算，含C11H18N2O3不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2984","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Amobarbital Tablets","zh":"异戊巴比妥片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含异戊巴比妥（C11H18N2O3）应为标示量的94.0%～106.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/2985","@type":"IndexedMon