h":"苄星青霉素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"（C16H18N2O4S）2•C16H20N2•4H2O　981.19\n\n［41372-02-5］\n\n本品为（2S，5R，6R）-3，3-二甲基-7-氧代-6-（2-苯乙酰氨基）-4-硫杂-1-氮杂双环［3.2.0］庚烷-2-甲酸的N，N′-二苄基乙二胺盐四水合物，或加适量缓冲剂及助悬剂制成的无菌粉末。按无水物计算，含二苄基乙二胺（C16H20N2）应为24.0%～27.0%，含青霉素（C16H18N2O4S）应为69.9%～75.0%，每1mg含青霉素应为1244～1335单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3023","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Benzathine Benzylpenicillin for Injection","zh":"注射用苄星青霉素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为青霉素的二苄基乙二胺盐加适量缓冲剂及助悬剂制成的无菌粉末。按无水物计算，含二苄基乙二胺（C16H20N2）应为24.0%～27.0%，含青霉素（C16H18N2O4S）应为69.9%～75.0%，每1mg含青霉素应为1244～1335单位；按平均装量计算，含青霉素（C16H18N2O4S）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3024","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Bendroflumethiazide","zh":"苄氟噻嗪"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C15H14F3N3O4S2　421.41\n\n［73-48-3］\n\n本品为3-苄基-6-三氟甲基-7-磺酰氨基-3，4-二氢-2H-1，2，4-苯并噻二嗪-1，1-二氧化物。按干燥品计算，含C15H14F3N3O4S2应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3025","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Bendroflumethiazide Tablets","zh":"苄氟噻嗪片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含苄氟噻嗪（C15H14F3N3O4S2）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3026","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Clavulanate Potassium","zh":"克拉维酸钾"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C8H8KNO5　237.25\n\n［61177-45-5］\n\n本品为（Z）-（2S，5R）-3-（2-羟亚乙基）-7-氧代-4-氧杂-1-氮杂双环［3.2.0］庚烷-2-羧酸钾。按无水物计算，含克拉维酸（C8H9NO5）应为81.0%～85.6%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3027","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Amoxicillin and Clavulanate Potassium for Suspension","zh":"阿莫西林克拉维酸钾干混悬剂"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为阿莫西林和克拉维酸钾的混合制剂［阿莫西林（按C16H19N3O5S计）与克拉维酸（C8H9NO5）标示量之比为4∶1或7∶1或14∶1］，含阿莫西林（按C16H19N3O5S计