xedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"LIQUIDAMBARIS RESINA","zh":"枫香脂"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为金缕梅科植物枫香树Liquidambar formosana Hance的干燥树脂。7、8月间割裂树干，使树脂流出，10月至次年4月采收，阴干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3190","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Calcium Pantothenate Tablets","zh":"泛酸钙片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含泛酸钙（C18H32CaN2O10）应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3191","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Diatrizoic Acid","zh":"泛影酸"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C11H9I3N2O4•2H2O　649.95\n\n［50978-11-5］\n\n本品为3，5-二乙酰氨基-2，4，6-三碘苯甲酸二水合物。按干燥品计算，含C11H9I3N2O4不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3192","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Meglumine Diatrizoate Injection","zh":"泛影葡胺注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为泛影酸与等分子葡甲胺制成的灭菌水溶液。含泛影葡胺（C11H9I3N2O4•C7H17NO5）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3193","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Sodium Diatrizoate Injection","zh":"泛影酸钠注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为泛影酸用氢氧化钠中和后的灭菌水溶液。含泛影酸钠（C11H8I3N2NaO4）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3194","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Menotropins","zh":"尿促性素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为绝经妇女尿中提取的促性腺激素，主要含卵泡刺激素（follicle-stimulating hormone，FSH）与黄体生成素（luteinising hormone，LH）。每1mg中卵泡刺激素效价不得少于400单位，黄体生成素的效价与卵泡刺激素效价的比值约为1。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3195","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Menotropins for Injection","zh":"注射用尿促性素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为尿促性素加适宜的赋形剂溶解，经冷冻干燥制得的无菌制品。含卵泡刺激素和黄体生成素效价均应为标示量的76%～135%。黄体生成素的效价与卵泡刺激素效价的比值约为1。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3196","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Urea","zh":"尿素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"CH4N2O　60.06\n\n［57-13-6］\n\n本品按干燥品计算，含CH4N2O应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3197","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Urea Ointment","zh":"尿素软膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含尿素（CH4N2O）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3198","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Urea Cream","zh":"尿素乳膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含尿素（CH4N2O）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3199","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Urokinase","zh":"尿激酶"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"［9039-53-6］\n\n本品系从新鲜人尿中提取的一种能激活纤维蛋白溶酶原的酶。它是由高分子量尿激酶（MW 54 000）和低分子量尿激酶（MW 33 000）组成的混合物，高分子量尿激酶含量不得少于90%，每1mg蛋白中尿激酶活力不得少于12万单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/32","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"ALLII SATIVI BULBUS","zh":"大蒜"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为百合科植物大蒜Allium sativum L.的鳞茎。夏季叶枯时采挖，除去须根和泥沙，通风晾晒至外皮干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/320","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"ACANTHOPANACIS SENTICOSI RADIX ET RHIZOMA SEU CAULIS","zh":"刺五加"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为五加科植物刺五加Acanthopanax senticosus（Rupr. et Maxim.）Harms的干燥根和根茎或茎。春、秋二季采收，洗净，干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3200","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Urokinase for Injection","zh":"注射用尿激酶"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为尿激酶加适量稳定剂和赋形剂的无菌冻干品。本品的尿激酶活力单位应为标示量的85.0%～120.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3201","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Opium","zh":"阿片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为罂粟科植物罂粟Papaver somniferumL.的未成熟蒴果被划破后渗出的乳状液经干燥制成。含吗啡按无水吗啡（C17H19NO3）计算，不得少于9.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3202","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Powdered Opium","zh":"阿片粉"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为阿片在70℃以下干燥，研细，测定含量后，加乳糖或其他稀释剂，研匀制成。含吗啡按无水吗啡（C17H19NO3）计算，应为9.5%～10.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3203","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Opium Tablets","zh":"阿片片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为阿片粉压制片，每片含吗啡按无水吗啡（C17H19NO3）计算，应为4.5～5.5mg。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3204","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Opium Tincture","zh":"阿片酊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含无水吗啡（C17H19NO3）应为0.95%～1.05%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3205","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Compound Platycodon Tablets","zh":"阿桔片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品每片中含无水吗啡（C17H19NO3）应为2.7～3.3mg。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3206","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Alendronate Sodium","zh":"阿仑膦酸钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C4H12NNaO7P2•3H2O　325.12\n\n［121268-17-5］\n\n本品为（4-氨基-1-羟基丁叉基）-1，1-二膦酸单钠盐三水化合物。按干燥品计算，含C4H12NNaO7P2不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3207","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Alendronate Sodium Tablets","zh":"阿仑膦酸钠片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含阿仑膦酸钠按阿仑膦酸（C4H13NO7P2）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3208","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Alendronate Sodium Enteric-coated Tablets","zh":"阿仑膦酸钠肠溶片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含阿仑膦酸钠按阿仑膦酸（C4H13NO7P2）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.