ata/chp/monographs/35","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"ARECAE PERICARPIUM","zh":"大腹皮"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为棕榈科植物槟榔Areca catechu L.的干燥果皮。冬季至次春采收未成熟的果实，煮后干燥，纵剖两瓣，剥取果皮，习称\"大腹皮\"；春末至秋初采收成熟果实，煮后干燥，剥取果皮，打松，晒干，习称\"大腹毛\"。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/350","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"RHODODENDRI MOLLIS FLOS","zh":"闹羊花"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为杜鹃花科植物羊踯躅Rhododendron molle G. Don的干燥花。4～5月花初开时采收，阴干或晒干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3500","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Fluorescein Sodium","zh":"荧光素钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C20H10Na2O5　376.27\n\n［518-47-8］\n\n本品为9-（邻羧基苯基）-6-羟基-3H-呫吨-3-酮二钠盐。按无水物计算，含C20H10Na2O5应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3501","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Fluorescein Sodium Injection","zh":"荧光素钠注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为荧光素钠的灭菌水溶液。含荧光素钠（C20H10Na2O5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3502","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Medicinal Charcoal","zh":"药用炭"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"［7440-44-0］"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3503","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Medicinal Charcoal Tablets","zh":"药用炭片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为黑色或灰黑色片或薄膜衣片，除去包衣后显黑色或灰黑色。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3504","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Medicinal Charcoal Capsules","zh":"药用炭胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品的内容物为黑色粉末或颗粒。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3505","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Diethylcarbamazine Citrate","zh":"枸橼酸乙胺嗪"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":