Label":{"en":"Bismuth Potassium Citrate Granules","zh":"枸橼酸铋钾颗粒"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含枸橼酸铋钾以铋（Bi）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3531","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Ranitidine Bismuth Citrate","zh":"枸橼酸铋雷尼替丁"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为雷尼替丁与枸橼酸铋生成的组成不定的复合物。按干燥品计算，雷尼替丁与枸橼酸铋量为1∶1者，含雷尼替丁（C13H22N4O3S）应为42.5%～45.5%；雷尼替丁与枸橼酸铋量为1∶1.1者，含雷尼替丁（C13H22N4O3S）应为39.5%～42.5%；含枸橼酸铋以铋（Bi）计算，均应为27.5%～30.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3532","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Ranitidine Bismuth Citrate Tablets","zh":"枸橼酸铋雷尼替丁片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为枸橼酸铋与雷尼替丁的复合物。雷尼替丁与枸橼酸铋量为1∶1.1，每片含枸橼酸铋以铋（Bi）计算，应为52.0～64.0mg；含雷尼替丁（C13H22N4O3S）应为72.0～88.0mg。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3533","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Ranitidine Bismuth Citrate Capsules","zh":"枸橼酸铋雷尼替丁胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含枸橼酸铋雷尼替丁复合物。雷尼替丁与枸橼酸铋量为1∶1.1者，每粒含雷尼替丁（C13H22N4O3S）应为72.0～88.0mg，含枸橼酸铋以铋（Bi）计算，应为52.0～64.0mg；雷尼替丁与枸橼酸铋量为1∶1者，每粒含雷尼替丁（C13H22N4O3S）应为139～169mg，含枸橼酸铋以铋（Bi）计算，应为91～111mg。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3534","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pentoxyverine Citrate","zh":"枸橼酸喷托维林"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C20H31NO3•C6H8O7　525.60\n\n［23142-01-0］\n\n本品为2-［2-（二乙氨基）乙氧基］乙基1-苯基环戊烷-1-羧酸酯枸橼酸盐。按干燥品计算，含C20H31NO3•C6H8O7不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3535","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pentoxyverine Citrate Tablets","zh":"枸橼酸喷托维林片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含枸橼酸喷托维林（C20H31NO3•C6H8O7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3536","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pentoxyverine Citrate Pills"