55","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"ALISMATIS RHIZOMA","zh":"泽泻"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为泽泻科植物东方泽泻Alisma orientale（Sam.）Juzep.或泽泻Alisma plantago-aquatica Linn.的干燥块茎。冬季茎叶开始枯萎时采挖，洗净，干燥，除去须根和粗皮。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3550","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Saccharated Pepsin","zh":"含糖胃蛋白酶"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品系胃蛋白酶用乳糖、葡萄糖或蔗糖稀释制得。按干燥品计算，每1g中含蛋白酶活力不得少于120单位或1200单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3551","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pipecuronium Bromide","zh":"哌库溴铵"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C35H62Br2N4O4　762.71\n\n［52212-02-9］\n\n本品为二溴化4，4′-（3α，17β-二羟基-5α-雄甾-2β，16β-二基）-双-（1，1-二甲基哌啶）-3，17-二乙酸酯。按无水、无溶剂物计算，含哌库溴铵（C35H62Br2N4O4）应为97.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3552","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pipecuronium Bromide for Injection","zh":"注射用哌库溴铵"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为哌库溴铵加适量甘露醇制成的无菌冻干品，含哌库溴铵（C35H62Br2N4O4）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3553","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Piperacillin","zh":"哌拉西林"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C23H27N5O7S•H2O　535.57\n\n［66258-76-2］\n\n本品为（2S，5R，6R）-3，3-二甲基-6-［（R）-2-（4-乙基-2，3-二氧代-1-哌嗪甲酰氨基）-2-苯乙酰氨基］-7-氧代-4-硫杂-1-氮杂双环［3.2.0］庚烷-2-甲酸一水合物。按无水物计算，含哌拉西林（按C23H27N5O7S计）不得少于92.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3554","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Piperacillin Sodium","zh":"哌拉西林钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C23H26N5NaO7S　539.54\n\n［59703-84-3］\n\n本品为（2S，5R，6R）-3，3-二甲基-6-［（R）-2-（4-乙基-2，3-二氧代-1-哌嗪甲酰氨基）-2-苯乙酰氨基］-7-氧代-4-硫杂-1-氮杂双环［3.2.0］庚烷-2-甲酸钠盐。按无水物计算，含哌拉西林（按C23H27N5O7S计）不得少于87.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3555","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Piperacillin Sodium for Injection","zh":"注射用哌拉西林钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为哌拉西林钠的无菌粉末或无菌冻干品。按无水物计算，含哌拉西林（按C23H27N5O7S计）不得少于87.0%；按平均装量计算，含哌拉西林（按C23H27N5O7S计）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3556","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Piperacillin Sodium and Tazobactam Sodium for Injection","zh":"注射用哌拉西林钠他唑巴坦钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为哌拉西林钠与他唑巴坦钠［哌拉西林（按C23H27N5O7S计）和他唑巴坦（C10H12N4O5S）标示量之比为8∶1］均匀混合的无菌冻干粉末。按无水物计算，每1mg中含哌拉西林（按C23H27N5O7S计）不得少于765μg，含他唑巴坦（C10H12N4O5S）不得少于96μg；按平均装量计算，含哌拉西林（按C23H27N5O7S计）与他唑巴坦（C10H12N4O5S）均应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3557","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Halcinonide","zh":"哈西奈德"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C24H32ClFO5　454.96\n\n［3093-35-4］\n\n本品为21-氯-9a-氟-11，16a，17a-三羟基孕甾-4-烯-3，20-二酮环-16，17-缩丙酮。按干燥品计算，含C24H32ClFO5应为97.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3558","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Halcinonide Ointment","zh":"哈西奈德软膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含哈西奈德（C24H32ClFO5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3559","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Halcinonide Cream","zh":"哈西奈德乳膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含哈西奈德（C24H32ClFO5）应为标示量的85.0%～115.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/356","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"DALBERGIAE ODORIFERAE LIGNUM","zh":"降香"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为豆科植物降香檀Dalbergia odorifera T. Chen树干和根的干燥心材。全年均可采收，除去边材，阴干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3560","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Halcinonide Film","zh":"哈西奈德涂膜"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","