ographs/3825","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Cysteine Hydrochloride","zh":"盐酸半胱氨酸"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C3H7NO2S•HCl•H2O　175.63\n\n［7048-04-6］\n\n本品为L-2-氨基-3-巯基丙酸盐酸盐一水合物。按干燥品计算，含C3H7NO2S•HCl不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3826","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Cefmenoxime Hydrochloride","zh":"盐酸头孢甲肟"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"（C16H17N9O5S3）2•HCl　1059.56\n\n［75738-58-8］\n\n本品为（6R，7R）-7-［（Z）-2-（2-氨基-4-噻唑基）-2-甲氧亚氨基乙酰氨基］-3-［［（1-甲基-1H-四氮唑-5-基）硫基］甲基］-8-氧代-5-硫杂-1-氮杂双环［4.2.0］辛-2-烯-2-甲酸盐酸盐（2∶1）。按无水物计算，含头孢甲肟（C16H17N9O5S3）不得少于89.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3827","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Cefmenoxime Hydrochloride for Injection","zh":"注射用盐酸头孢甲肟"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为盐酸头孢甲肟加适量无水碳酸钠为助溶剂制成的无菌粉末。按平均装量计算，含头孢甲肟（C16H17N9O5S3）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3828","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Cefetamet Pivoxil Hydrochloride","zh":"盐酸头孢他美酯"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C20H25N5O7S2•HCl　548.03\n\n［111696-23-2］\n\n本品为（6R，7R）-3-甲基-7-［（Z）-2-（2-氨基-4-噻唑基）-2-（甲氧亚氨基）乙酰氨基］-8-氧代-5-硫杂-1-氮杂双环［4，2，0］辛-2-烯-2-甲酸新戊酰氧甲酯盐酸盐。按无水物计算，含头孢他美（C14H15N5O5S2）不得少于69.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3829","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Cefetamet Pivoxil Hydrochloride for Suspension","zh":"盐酸头孢他美酯干混悬剂"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含盐酸头孢他美酯按头孢他美（C14H15N5O5S2）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～120.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/383","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"BAPHICACANTHIS CUSIAE RHIZOMA ET RADIX","zh":"南板蓝根"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为爵床科植物马蓝Baphicacanthus cusia（Nees）Bremek.的干燥根茎和根。夏、秋二季采挖，除去地上茎，洗净，晒干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.open