5.8%～19.2%；以碳酸钠及精氨酸为辅料的制剂，按干燥品计，含碳酸钠应为3.8%～5.2%，含精氨酸（C6H14N4O2）应为26.5%～32.3%。按干燥品、无碳酸钠或无碳酸钠及无精氨酸物计算，含头孢替安（C18H23N9O4S3）应为79.0%～92.5%；按平均装量计算，含盐酸头孢替安按头孢替安（C18H23N9O4S3）计应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3836","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Selegiline Hydrochloride","zh":"盐酸司来吉兰"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C13H17N•HCl　223.74\n\n［14611-52-0］\n\n本品为（2R）-N-甲基-1-苯基-N-丙-2-炔基丙-2-胺盐酸盐。按干燥品计算，含C13H17N•HCl应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3837","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Selegiline Hydrochloride Tablets","zh":"盐酸司来吉兰片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含盐酸司来吉兰（C13H17N•HCl）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3838","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nicardipine Hydrochloride","zh":"盐酸尼卡地平"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C26H29N3O6•HCl　515.99\n\n［54527-84-3］\n\n本品为5-O-［2-［苄基（甲基）氨基］乙基］3-O-甲基2，6-二甲基-4-（3-硝基苯基）-1，4-二氢吡啶-3，5-二羧酸酯盐酸盐。按干燥品计算，含C26H29N3O6•HCl不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3839","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nicardipine Hydrochloride Tablets","zh":"盐酸尼卡地平片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含盐酸尼卡地平（C26H29N3O6•HCl）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/384","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"CAROTAE FRUCTUS","zh":"南鹤虱"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为伞形科植物野胡萝卜Daucus carota L.的干燥成熟果实。秋季果实成熟时割取果枝，晒干，打下果实，除去杂质。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3840","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nicardipine Hydrochloride Injection","zh":"盐酸尼卡地平注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为盐酸尼卡地平的灭菌水溶液，含盐酸尼卡地平（C26H29N3O6•HCl）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3841","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nicardipine Hydrochloride and Glucose Injection","zh":"盐酸尼卡地平葡萄糖注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为盐酸尼卡地平与葡萄糖的灭菌水溶液。含盐酸尼卡地平（C26H29N3O6•HCl）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%；含葡萄糖（C6H12O6•H2O）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3842","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Gemcitabine Hydrochloride","zh":"盐酸吉西他滨"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C9H11F2N3O4•HCl　299.66\n\n［122111-03-9］\n\n本品为2′-脱氧-2′，2′-二氟胞苷（β-异构体）盐酸盐。按干燥品计算，含C9H11F2N3O4•HCl应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3843","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Gemcitabine Hydrochloride for Injection","zh":"注射用盐酸吉西他滨"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为盐酸吉西他滨的无菌冻干品，含盐酸吉西他滨按吉西他滨（C9H11F2N3O4）计算，应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3844","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Tropisetron Hydrochloride","zh":"盐酸托烷司琼"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C17H20N2O2•HCl　320.82\n\n［105826-92-4］\n\n本品为吲哚-3-甲酸1αH，5αH-托品-3α-醇酯盐酸盐。按干燥品计算，含C17H20N2O2•HCl不得少于99.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3845","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Tropisetron Hydrochloride Tablets","zh":"盐酸托烷司琼片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含盐酸托烷司琼按托烷司琼（C17H20N2O2）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3846","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Tropisetron Hydrochloride Injection","zh":"盐酸托烷司琼注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为盐酸托烷司琼的灭菌水溶液，含盐酸托烷司琼按托烷司琼（C17H20N2O2）计算，应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/3847","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Tropisetron Hydrochloride Capsules","zh":"盐酸托烷司琼胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monog