lsh.的干燥枝皮或干皮。春、秋二季剥取，晒干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4260","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Betamethasone Tablets","zh":"倍他米松片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含倍他米松（C22H29FO5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4261","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Betamethasone Cream","zh":"倍他米松乳膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含倍他米松（C22H29FO5）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4262","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Betamethasone Sodium Phosphate","zh":"倍他米松磷酸钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C22H28FNa2O8P　516.41\n\n［151-73-5］\n\n本品为16β-甲基-11β，17α，21-三羟基-9α-氟孕甾-1，4-二烯-3，20-二酮-21-磷酸二钠盐。按无水物计算，含C22H28FNa2O8P应为96.0%～103.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4263","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Betamethasone Sodium Phosphate Injection","zh":"倍他米松磷酸钠注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为倍他米松磷酸钠的灭菌水溶液。含倍他米松磷酸钠按倍他米松（C22H29FO5）计，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。\n\n本品可加适量的稳定剂及助溶剂。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4264","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Insulin","zh":"胰岛素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C256H381N65O76S6　5778\n\n［12584-58-6］\n\n本品系自猪胰中提取制得的由51个氨基酸残基组成的蛋白质。按干燥品计算，含胰岛素（包括脱氨胰岛素）应为95.5%～105.0%。\n\n每1单位相当于胰岛素0.0345mg。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4265","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Insulin Injection","zh":"胰岛素注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为胰岛素的无菌水溶液。其效价应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。\n\n本品每100ml中可加甘油1.4～1.8g、苯酚0.25g。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4266","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Protamine Zinc Insulin Injection","zh":"精蛋白锌胰岛素注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为含有鱼精蛋白与氯化锌的胰岛素的无菌混悬液，其效价应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。\n\n本品每100单位中含有鱼精蛋白1.0～1.5mg与锌0.2～0.25mg；每100ml中可加甘油1.4～1.8g，苯酚0.25g。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4267","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Isophane Protamine Insulin Injection（30R）","zh":"精蛋白锌胰岛素注射液（30R）"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品系由胰岛素制成的溶液与鱼精蛋白和胰岛素制成的混悬液按一定比例混合而成的无菌混悬液。总胰岛素效价应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%，其中可溶性胰岛素的效价应为总胰岛素含量的25.0%～35.0%。\n\n本品可加入适量的苯酚作为抑菌剂。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4268","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Trypsin","zh":"胰蛋白酶"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"［9002-07-7］\n\n本品系自猪、羊或牛胰中提取的蛋白分解酶。按干燥品计算，每1mg中胰蛋白酶的活力不得少于2500单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4269","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Trypsin for Injection","zh":"注射用胰蛋白酶"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为胰蛋白酶的无菌冻干品。含胰蛋白酶的活力单位应为标示量的90.0%～120.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/427","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"PANACIS MAJORIS RHIZOMA","zh":"珠子参"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为五加科植物珠子参Panax japonicus C. A. Mey. var. major（Burk.）C. Y. Wu et K. M. Feng或羽叶三七Panaxjaponicus C. A. Mey. var. bipinnatifidus（Seem.）C. Y. Wu et K. M. Feng的干燥根茎。秋季采挖，除去粗皮和须根，干燥；或蒸（煮）透后干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4270","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pancreatin","zh":"胰酶"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"［8049-47-6］\n\n本品系自猪、羊或牛胰中提取的多种酶的混合物，主要为胰蛋白酶、胰淀粉酶与胰脂肪酶。按干燥品计算，每1g中含胰蛋白酶活力不得少于600单位，胰淀粉酶活力不得少于7000单位，胰脂肪酶活力不得少于4000单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4271","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pancreatin Enteric-coated Tablets","zh":"胰酶肠溶片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品按胰酶的标示量计算，每1g含胰蛋白酶活力不得少于540单位，胰淀粉酶活力不得少于6300单位，胰脂肪酶活力不得少于3400单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4272","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pancreatin Enteric Capsules","zh":"胰酶肠溶胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品按胰酶的标示量计算，以干燥品计，每1g中含胰蛋白酶活力不得少于540单位，胰淀粉酶活力不得少于6300单位，胰脂肪酶活力不得少于3400单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4273","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pancreatic Kininogenase","zh":"胰激肽原酶"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"［9001-01-8］\n\n本品系自猪胰中提取的蛋白酶。每1mg蛋白含胰激肽原酶的活力不得少于300单位（供口服用）或600单位（供注射用）。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4274","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Pancreatic Kininogenase Enteric-coated Tablets","zh":"胰激肽原酶肠溶片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含胰激肽原酶的效价应不小于标示量的85.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4275","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Cystine","zh":"胱氨酸"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C6H12N2O4S2　240.29\n\n［56-89-3］\n\n本品为L-3，3′-二硫双（2-氨基丙酸）。按干燥品计算，含C6H12N2O4S2不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4276","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Cystine Tablets","zh":"胱氨酸片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含胱氨酸（C6H12N2O4S2）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4277","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Fat Emulsion Injection（C）","zh":"脂肪乳注射液（C<sub>14～24</sub>）"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品系由大豆油（供注射用）经乳化、均质制成的灭菌乳状液体。含大豆油应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4278","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Thymopentin","zh":"胸腺五肽"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C30H49N9O9　679.78\n\n［69558-55-0］\n\n本品系由五个氨基酸组成的合成多肽，为N-［N-［N-［N2-L-精氨酰-L-赖氨酰］-L-α-天门冬氨酰］-L-缬氨酰］-L-酪氨酸。按无水、无溶剂与无醋酸物计算，含胸腺五肽（C30H49N9O9）应为97.0%～103.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4279","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Thymopentin Injection","zh":"胸腺五肽注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为胸腺五肽的灭菌水溶液，含胸腺五肽（C30H49N9O9）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/428","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"RAPHANI SEMEN","zh":"莱菔子"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为十字花科植物萝卜Raphanus sativus L.的干燥成熟种子。夏季果实成熟时采割植株，晒干，搓出种子，除去杂质，再晒干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4280","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Thymopentin for Injection","zh":"注射用胸腺五肽"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为胸腺五肽加适量甘露醇等赋形剂经冷冻、干燥制成的无菌冻干品。含胸腺五肽（C30H49N9O9）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4281","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Thymalfasin","zh":"胸腺法新"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"N-Acetyl-Ser-Asp-Ala-Ala-Val-Asp-Thr-Ser-Ser-Glu-Ile-\n\nThr-Thr-Lys-Asp-Leu-Lys-Glu-Lys-Lys-Glu-Val-Val-\n\nGlu-Glu-Ala-Glu-Asn-OH\n\nC129H215N33O55　3108.32\n\n［62304-98-7］\n\n本品为化学合成的由二十八个氨基酸组成的多肽。为N-乙酰基-L-丝氨酰-L-α-天冬氨酰-L-丙氨酰-L-丙氨酰-L-缬氨酰-L-α-天冬氨酰-L-苏氨酰-L-丝氨酰-L-丝氨酰-L-α-谷氨酰-L-异亮氨酰-L-苏氨酰-L-苏氨酰-L-赖氨酰-L-α-天冬氨酰-L-亮氨酰-L-赖氨酰-L-α-谷氨酰-L-赖氨酰-L-赖氨酰-L-α-谷氨酰-L-缬氨酰-L-缬氨酰-L-α-谷氨酰-L-α-谷氨酰-L-丙氨酰-L-α-谷氨酰-L-天冬酰胺。按无水、无醋酸物计算，含胸腺法新（C129H215N33O55）应为95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4282","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Thymalfasin for Injection","zh":"注射用胸腺法新"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为胸腺法新加适量赋形剂制成的无菌冻干品。含胸腺法新（C129H215N33O55）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4283","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Colloidal Bismuth Pectin","zh":"胶体果胶铋"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为一种果胶与铋生成的组成不定的复合物。含果胶铋以铋（Bi）计算，应为14.0%～16.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4284","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Colloidal Bismuth Pectin Capsules","zh":"胶体果胶铋胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含果胶铋以铋（Bi）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4285","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Homoharringtonine","zh":"高三尖杉酯碱"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C29H39NO9　545.63\n\n［26833-87-4］\n\n本品为从粗榧科植物三尖杉Cephalotaxus fortunei Hook.f.或其同属植物提取得到的一种生物碱。按干燥品计算，含C29H39NO9应为95.0%～103.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4286","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Homoharringtonine Injection","zh":"高三尖杉酯碱注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为高三尖杉酯碱的灭菌水溶液，含高三尖杉酯碱（C29H39NO9）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4287","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Potassium Permanganate","zh":"高锰酸钾"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"KMnO4　158.03\n\n［7722-64-7］\n\n本品含KMnO4应为99.0%～100.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4288","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Potassium Permanganate Tablets for External Use","zh":"高锰酸钾外用片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含高锰酸钾（KMnO4）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4289","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Nicotinamide","zh":"烟酰胺"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C6H6N2O　122.13\n\n［98-92-0］\n\n本品为3-吡啶甲酰胺。按干燥品计算，含C6H6N2O不得少于99.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/429","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"NELUMBINIS SEMEN","zh":"莲子"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为睡莲科植物莲Nelumbo nucifera Gaertn.的干燥成熟种子。秋季果实成熟时采割莲房，取出果实，除去果皮，干燥，或除去莲子心后干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/c