zh":"烟酸占替诺氯化钠注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为烟酸占替诺与氯化钠的灭菌水溶液，含烟酸占替诺（C13H21N5O4•C6H5NO2）应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%；含氯化钠（NaCl）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4298","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Vinorelbine Tartrate","zh":"酒石酸长春瑞滨"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C45H54N4O8•2C4H6O6　1079.12\n\n［125317-39-7］\n\n本品为3′，4′-二去氢-4′-去氧-C′-去甲长春碱二酒石酸盐。按无水物计算，含C45H54N4O8•2C4H6O6应为98.0%～102.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4299","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Vinorelbine Tartrate Injection","zh":"酒石酸长春瑞滨注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为酒石酸长春瑞滨的灭菌水溶液，含酒石酸长春瑞滨按长春瑞滨（C45H54N4O8）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/43","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"CRATAEGI FRUCTUS","zh":"山楂"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为蔷薇科植物山里红Crataegus pinnatifida Bge. var. major N. E. Br.或山楂Crataegus pinnatifida Bge.的干燥成熟果实。秋季果实成熟时采收，切片，干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/430","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"NELUMBINIS PLUMULA","zh":"莲子心"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为睡莲科植物莲Nelumbo nucifera Gaertn.的成熟种子中的干燥幼叶及胚根。取出，晒干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4300","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Dihydrocodeine Bitartrate","zh":"酒石酸双氢可待因"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C18H23NO3•C4H6O6　451.47\n\n［5965-13-9］\n\n本品为4，5α-氧桥-3-甲氧基-17-甲基吗啡喃-6α-醇酒石酸盐。按干燥品计算，含C18H23NO3•C4H6O6不得少于98.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4301","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Dihydrocodeine Bitartrate Tablets","zh":"酒石酸双氢可待因片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含酒石酸双氢可待因（C18H23NO3•C4H6O6）应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.op