丁胺醇按沙丁胺醇（C13H21NO3）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/457","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"LEONURI HERBA","zh":"益母草"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为唇形科植物益母草Leonurus japonicus Houtt.的新鲜或干燥地上部分。鲜品春季幼苗期至初夏花前期采割；干品夏季茎叶茂盛、花未开或初开时采割，晒干，或切段晒干。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4570","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Salbutamol Sulfate Inhalation Aerosol","zh":"硫酸沙丁胺醇吸入气雾剂"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸沙丁胺醇的混悬型吸入气雾剂，贮藏于有定量阀门系统的密封容器中。平均每揿含沙丁胺醇（C13H21NO3）应为标示量的80.0%～120.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4571","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Salbutamol Sulfate Powder for Inhalation","zh":"硫酸沙丁胺醇吸入粉雾剂"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为微粉化硫酸沙丁胺醇和适宜的辅料混合均匀后装入胶囊制成的供吸入用粉雾剂，置于专用装置中使用。含硫酸沙丁胺醇按沙丁胺醇（C13H21NO3）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～115.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4572","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Salbutamol Sulfate Injection","zh":"硫酸沙丁胺醇注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸沙丁胺醇的灭菌水溶液。含硫酸沙丁胺醇按沙丁胺醇（C13H21NO3）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4573","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Salbutamol Sulfate Capsules","zh":"硫酸沙丁胺醇胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸沙丁胺醇按沙丁胺醇（C13H21NO3）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4574","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Salbutamol Sulfate Sustained-release Tablets","zh":"硫酸沙丁胺醇缓释片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸沙丁胺醇按沙丁胺醇（C13H21NO3）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4575","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Salbutamol Sulfate Sustained-release Capsules","zh":"硫酸沙丁胺醇缓释胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸沙丁胺醇按沙丁胺醇（C13H21NO3）计算，应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4576","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Atropine Sulfate","zh":"硫酸阿托品"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"（C17H23NO3）2•H2SO4•H2O　694.84\n\n［5908-99-6］\n\n本品为（±）-α-（羟甲基）苯乙酸-8-甲基-8-氮杂双环［3.2.1］-3-辛酯硫酸盐一水合物。按干燥品计算，含（C17H23NO3）2•H2SO4不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4577","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Atropine Sulfate Tablets","zh":"硫酸阿托品片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸阿托品［（C17H23NO3）2•H2SO4•H2O］应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4578","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Atropine Sulfate Injection","zh":"硫酸阿托品注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸阿托品的灭菌水溶液。含硫酸阿托品［（C17H23NO3）2•H2SO4•H2O］应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4579","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Atropine Sulfate Eye Ointment","zh":"硫酸阿托品眼膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸阿托品［（C17H23NO3）2•H2SO4•H2O］应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/458","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"ALPINIAE OXYPHYLLAE FRUCTUS","zh":"益智"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为姜科植物益智Alpinia oxyphylla Miq.的干燥成熟果实。夏、秋间果实由绿变红时采收，晒干或低温干燥。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4580","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Amikacin Sulfate","zh":"硫酸阿米卡星"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"n=1.8，C22H43N5O13•1.8H2SO4　　762.14\n\nn=2，C22H43N5O13•2H2SO4　　　　781.75\n\n［39831-55-5（二硫酸盐）］\n\n本品为O-3-氨基-3-脱氧-α-D-葡吡喃糖基-（1→4）-O-［6-氨基-6-脱氧-α-D-葡吡喃糖基-（1→6）］-N3-（4-氨基-2-羟基-1-氧代丁基）-2-脱氧-L-链霉胺硫酸盐。按干燥品计算，含阿米卡星（C22H43N5O13）应为73.0%～78.4%（n=1.8）或71.1%～76.4%（n=2）。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4581","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Amikacin Sulfate Injection","zh":"硫酸阿米卡星注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸阿米卡星的灭菌水溶液。含阿米卡星（C22H43N5O13）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4582","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Amikacin Sulfate for Injection","zh":"注射用硫酸阿米卡星"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸阿米卡星的无菌粉末或结晶性粉末或无菌冻干品。按平均装量计算，含阿米卡星（C22H43N5O13）应为标示量的93.0%～107.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4583","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Indinavir Sulfate Capsules","zh":"硫酸茚地那韦胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸茚地那韦按茚地那韦（C36H47N5O4）计算，应为标示量的93.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4584","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Chondroitin Sulfate Sodium","zh":"硫酸软骨素钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"H（C14H19NNa2O14S）xOH\n\n本品系自猪的喉骨、鼻中骨、气管等软骨组织中提取制得的硫酸化链状黏多糖钠盐。硫酸软骨素钠主要由N-乙酰半乳糖胺（2-乙酰胺-2-脱氧-β-D-吡喃半乳糖）和D-葡萄糖醛酸的共聚物的硫酸酯钠盐构成，共聚物内己糖通过β-1，3及β-1，4糖苷键交替连接。按干燥品计算，含硫酸软骨素钠［H（C14H19NNa2O14S）xOH］应为90.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4585","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Chondroitin Sulfate Sodium Tablets","zh":"硫酸软骨素钠片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸软骨素钠［H（C14H19NNa2O14S）xOH］应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4586","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Chondroitin Sulfate Sodium Capsules","zh":"硫酸软骨素钠胶囊"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸软骨素钠［H（C14H19NNa2O14S）xOH］应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4587","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Netilmicin Sulfate","zh":"硫酸奈替米星"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"（C21H41N5O7）2•5H2SO4　1441.53\n\n［56391-57-2］\n\n本品为O-3-去氧-4-C-甲基-3-甲氨基-β-L-阿拉伯糖吡喃糖基（1→4）-O-［2，6二氨基-2，3，4，6-四去氧-α-D-甘油基-4-烯己吡喃糖基-（1→6）］-2-去氧-N3-乙基-L-链霉胺硫酸盐。按无水物计算，每1mg的效价不得少于610奈替米星单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4588","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Netilmicin Sulfate Injection","zh":"硫酸奈替米星注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸奈替米星的灭菌水溶液。含奈替米星（C21H41N5O7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4589","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Etimicin Sulfate","zh":"硫酸依替米星"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"（C21H43N5O7）2•5H2SO4　1445.57\n\n本品为O-2-氨基-2，3，4，6-四脱氧-6-氨基-α-D-赤型-己吡喃糖基-（1→4）-O-［3-脱氧-4-C-甲基-3（甲氨基）-β-L-阿拉伯吡喃糖基-（1→6）］-2-脱氧-N-乙基-L-链霉胺硫酸盐。按无水物计算，含依替米星（C21H43N5O7）不得少于59.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/459","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"FRITILLARIAE THUNBERGII BULBUS","zh":"浙贝母"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为百合科植物浙贝母Fritillaria thunbergii Miq.的干燥鳞茎。初夏植株枯萎时采挖，洗净。大小分开，大者除去芯芽，习称\"大贝\"；小者不去芯芽，习称\"珠贝\"。分别撞擦，除去外皮，拌以煅过的贝壳粉，吸去擦出的浆汁，干燥；或取鳞茎，大小分开，洗净，除去芯芽，趁鲜切成厚片，洗净，干燥，习称\"浙贝片\"。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4590","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Etimicin Sulfate Injection","zh":"硫酸依替米星注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸依替米星的灭菌水溶液，含依替米星（C21H43N5O7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4591","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Etimicin Sulfate for Injection","zh":"注射用硫酸依替米星"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸依替米星的无菌冻干品。按平均装量计算，含依替米星（C21H43N5O7）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4592","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Protamine Sulfate","zh":"硫酸鱼精蛋白"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品系自适宜的鱼类新鲜成熟精子中提取的一种碱性蛋白质的硫酸盐。按干燥品计算，每1mg所中和的肝素抗血凝作用不得少于100单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4593","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Protamine Sulfate Injection","zh":"硫酸鱼精蛋白注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸鱼精蛋白加氯化钠使成等渗的无菌水溶液。按每1mg硫酸鱼精蛋白中和肝素100单位计算，其效价应为标示量的90%～115%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4594","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Capreomycin Sulfate","zh":"硫酸卷曲霉素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"卷曲霉素ⅠA：C25H44N14O8　668.72；\n\n卷曲霉素ⅠB：C25H44N14O7　652.72；\n\n卷曲霉素ⅡA：C19H31N12O7　539.53；\n\n卷曲霉素ⅡB：C19H31N12O6　523.54。\n\n本品为卷曲霉素的二硫酸盐，卷曲霉素为碱性水溶性多肽的混合物。按干燥品计算，每1mg的效价不得少于830卷曲霉素单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4595","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Capreomycin Sulfate for Injection","zh":"注射用硫酸卷曲霉素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为硫酸卷曲霉素的无菌粉末或无菌冻干品。按干燥品计算，每1mg的效价不得少于830卷曲霉素单位；按平均装量计算，含卷曲霉素应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4596","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Quinine Sulfate","zh":"硫酸奎宁"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"（C20H24N2O2）2•H2SO4•2H2O　782.95\n\n［6119-70-6］\n\n本品为（8S，9R）-6′-甲氧基-脱氧辛可宁-9-醇硫酸盐二水合物。按干燥品计算，含（C20H24N2O2）2•H2SO4不得少于99.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4597","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Quinine Sulfate Tablets","zh":"硫酸奎宁片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含硫酸奎宁［（C20H24N2O2）2•H2SO4•2H2O］应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4598","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Quinidine Sulfate","zh":"硫酸奎尼丁"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"（C20H24N2O2）2•H2SO4•2H2O　782.95\n\n［6591-63-5］\n\n本品为（9S）-6′-甲氧基-脱氧辛可宁-9-醇硫酸盐二水合物。按干燥品计算，含（C20H24N2O2）2•H2SO4不得少于99.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monogra