phar.org/data/chp/monographs/4731","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Sulbactam Sodium","zh":"舒巴坦钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C8H10NNaO5S　255.22\n\n［69388-84-7］\n\n本品为（2S，5R）-3，3-二甲基-7-氧代-4-硫杂-1-氮杂双环［3.2.0］庚烷-2-羧酸钠-4，4-二氧化物。按无水物计算，含舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）不得少于88.6%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4732","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Sulbactam Sodium for Injection","zh":"注射用舒巴坦钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为舒巴坦钠的无菌粉末。按无水物计算，含舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）不得少于88.6%；按平均装量计算，含舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4733","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Cefoperazone Sodium and Sulbactam Sodium for Injection","zh":"注射用头孢哌酮钠舒巴坦钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为头孢哌酮钠与舒巴坦钠［头孢哌酮（C25H27N9O8S2）和舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）标示量之比为1∶1或2∶1］均匀混合的无菌粉末。按无水物计算，每1mg中含头孢哌酮（C25H27N9O8S2）和舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）分别不得少于435μg和445μg（配比为1∶1）或分别不得少于588μg和294μg（配比为2∶1）；按平均装量计算，含头孢哌酮（C25H27N9O8S2）与舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）均应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4734","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Ampicillin Sodium and Sulbactam Sodium for Injection","zh":"注射用氨苄西林钠舒巴坦钠"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为氨苄西林钠和舒巴坦钠［氨苄西林（按C16H19N3O4S计）和舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）标示量之比为2∶1］均匀混合的无菌粉末。按无水物计算，每1mg中含氨苄西林（按C16H19N3O4S计）和舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）分别不得少于563μg和280μg；按平均装量计算，含氨苄西林（按C16H19N3O4S计）和舒巴坦（C8H11NO5S）均应为标示量的90.0%～110.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4735","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Sulpiride","zh":"舒必利"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C15H23N3O4S　341.43\n\n［15676-16-1］\n\n本品为N-［（1-乙基-2-吡咯烷基）甲基］-2-甲氧基-5-（氨基磺酰基）苯甲酰胺。按干燥品计算，含C15H23N3O4S不得少于98.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4736","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Sulpiride Tablets","zh":"舒必利片"},"edition"