钙素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C145H240N44O48S2　3431.90\n\n［47931-85-1］\n\n本品为化学合成的由三十二个氨基酸组成的多肽，与天然鲑降钙素Ⅰ结构相同。按无水、无醋酸物计算，含鲑降钙素（C145H240N44O48S2）应为90.0%～105.0%。\n\n每1mg鲑降钙素相当于6000单位。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4879","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Calcitonin（Salmon）Injection","zh":"鲑降钙素注射液"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为鲑降钙素的无菌水溶液，不得含有抑菌剂。含鲑降钙素（C145H240N44O48S2）应为标示量的90.0%～115.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/488","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"CUSCUTAE SEMEN","zh":"菟丝子"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为旋花科植物南方菟丝子Cuscuta australis R. Br.或菟丝子Cuscuta chinensis Lam.的干燥成熟种子。秋季果实成熟时采收植株，晒干，打下种子，除去杂质。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4880","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Calcitonin（Salmon）for Injection","zh":"注射用鲑降钙素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品为鲑降钙素加适量稳定剂和赋形剂制成的无菌冻干制剂。含鲑降钙素（C145H240N44O48S2）应为标示量的90.0%～115.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4881","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Arginine","zh":"精氨酸"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C6H14N4O2　174.20\n\n［74-79-3］\n\n本品为L-2-氨基-5-胍基戊酸。按干燥品计算，含C6H14N4O2不得少于99.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4882","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Ursodeoxycholic Acid","zh":"熊去氧胆酸"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C24H40O4　392.58\n\n［128-13-2］\n\n本品为3α，7β-二羟基-5β-胆甾烷-24-酸。按干燥品计算，含C24H40O4不得少于98.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4883","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Ursodeoxycholic Acid Tablets","zh":"熊去氧胆酸片"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品含熊去氧胆酸（C24H40O4）应为标示量的95.0%～105.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/4884","@type":"IndexedMonogr