definition":{"la":"本品为甘草浸膏经加工制成的流浸膏。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/6300","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Borax","zh":"硼砂"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"Na2B4O7·10H 2O　381.36\n\n[1303-96-4]\n\n本品为四硼酸钠，含Na2B4O 7·10H2O应为99.0%～103.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/6301","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Boric Acid","zh":"硼酸"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"H3BO3　61.83\n\n[10043-35-3]\n\n本品按干燥品计算，含H3BO3不少于99.5%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/6302","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Microcrystalline Cellulose","zh":"微晶纤维素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"C 6 n H 10 n +2O 5 n +1\n\n[9004-34-6]\n\n本品系含纤维素植物的纤维浆制得的α-纤维素，在无机酸的作用下部分解聚，纯化而得。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/6303","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Microcrystalline Cellulose Spheres","zh":"微晶纤维素丸芯"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品系由微晶纤维素加水制粒干燥而成。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/6304","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Co-processed Microcrystalline Cellulose and Colloidal Silicon Dioxide","zh":"微晶纤维素胶态二氧化硅共处理物"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品由微晶纤维素和胶态二氧化硅在水中共混干燥制得。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/6305","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Co-processed Microcrystalline Cellulose and Carboxymethylcellulose Sodium","zh":"微晶纤维素羧甲纤维素钠共处理物"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"本品系由微晶纤维素与羧甲纤维素钠在水中共混，经喷雾干燥制得的共处理物。按干燥品计算，含羧甲纤维素钠应为标示量的75.0%～125.0%。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/6306","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"en":"Microcrystalline Wax","zh":"微晶蜡"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"en":"[63231-60-7]\n\n本品系从石油中制得的直链烃、支链烃与环状烃的混合物。"}},{"@id":"htt