US OIL","zh":"桉油"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为桃金娘科植物蓝桉Eucalyptus globulus Labill.、樟科植物樟Cinnamomum camphora（L.）Presl或上述两科同属其他植物经水蒸气蒸馏提取的挥发油。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/651","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"CENTELLA TOTAL GLUCOSIDES","zh":"积雪草总苷"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为伞形科植物积雪草Centella asiatica（L.）Urb.的全草经加工制成的总苷。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/652","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"LEONURUS LIQUID EXTRACT","zh":"益母草流浸膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为益母草经加工制成的流浸膏。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/653","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"FRITILLARY THUNBERG LIQUID EXTRACT","zh":"浙贝流浸膏"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为百合科植物浙贝母Fritillaria thunbergii Miq.的干燥鳞茎经加工制成的流浸膏。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/654","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"SCUTELLARIA EXTRACT","zh":"黄芩提取物"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为唇形科植物黄芩Scutellaria baicalensis Georgi的干燥根经加工制成的提取物。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/655","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"FIBRIURETININ","zh":"黄藤素"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"C21H22ClNO4　387.86\n\n本品为防己科植物黄藤Fibraurea recisa Pierre干燥藤茎中提取得到的生物碱。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/656","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"GINKGO LEAVES EXTRACT","zh":"银杏叶提取物"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为银杏科植物银杏Ginkgo biloba L.的干燥叶经加工制成的提取物。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openphar.org/data/chp/monographs/657","@type":"IndexedMonograph","prefLabel":{"la":"SESAME OIL","zh":"麻油"},"edition":"ChP-2025","category":"monographs","definition":{"la":"本品为脂麻科植物脂麻Sesamum indicum L.的成熟种子用压榨法得到的脂肪油。"}},{"@id":"https://www.openpha